      "text": "Good question! Just some informal thoughts... there's three \"moats\" to look at for $SIVE:\n\n- Capacity \n- Qualifications (especially for custom DFB lasers)\n- Technological\n\n1. For capacity, they're coming online with 100M+ CW DFB lasers Q4 2027 (global supply is roughly ~608M EML/CW lasers currently per Trendforce). \n\nObviously by 2027 global capacity is going to grow a lot, with $AAOI, $AVGO (3x expansion), and others coming online.  \n\nBut if you extrapolate their 2:1 statement, that implies 300m lasers/year long term coming from their own supply + external foundries. \n\nThis is incredibly valu",
